sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as API
    participant D as Database
    U->>+A: request
    A->>D: query
    D-->>A: rows
    Note over A,D: one transaction
    par cache
        A->>A: warm cache
    and audit
        A->D: log
    end
    critical commit
        A->>D: write
    end
    opt slow path
        A-->>U: progress
    end
    break failure
        A-->U: error
    end
    A-->>-U: response
